<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '0 40px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 80, width: '100%', background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 28px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1 }}>电商销量预测系统 · 课程答辩演示</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#B9CCEF' }}>04 目标达成度 · 性能实测</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 580, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 68, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>性能实测：端到端 11.85 秒完成 14 天预测</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>本机实测（8 逻辑核 / 23.8 GB / MX450 2 GB）</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 512, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 236, width: '100%', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
                <Chart
                    style={{ height: 236 }}
                    chartType='barChart'
                    barDirection='bar'
                    title='关键路径耗时对比（秒）'
                    titleColor='#0E3F8C'
                    showLegend={false}
                    showDataLabels={true}
                    axisColor='#8B97A8'
                    dataLabelColor='#1A2230'
                    colors={['#1E4FA8']}
                    background='#FFFFFF'
                    data={[
                        ['阶段', '耗时'],
                        ['端到端 14 天预测', 11.85],
                        ['CPU 回退模式', 23.49],
                        ['3 并发（单请求）', 37.6],
                    ]}
                />
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 120, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>14–21 ms</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>在线推理：单次请求内部实际计算耗时</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>504 / 140 ms</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>首屏 FCP：Edge 504 ms，Chrome 140 ms</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>250.3 s</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>极限施压触发 E_TIMEOUT 软失败（不拖垮服务）</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 132, width: '100%', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>单次请求相对 60 秒 SLA 留有约 5 倍余量，但 3 并发已把耗时推高到 37.6 秒。瓶颈在 CPU 侧的两遍推理流水线而非 I/O，因此容量规划应按「并发 3 以内」设上限，并发失控时宁可显式超时也不让请求静默排队。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>汇报人：吕治　·　2026 年 10 月　·　数据科学与大数据技术（2023.9–2027.6）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>14 / 18</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 20, width: '100%' }} />
</Slide>
